<view class="page"><view class="intro card hero-grad"><view class="pill pill-dark">今日状态</view><view class="intro-title">用 30 秒记录今天的身体状态</view><view class="intro-sub">这些数据会用于首页、趋势与个性化建议，但不会替代医学检查。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="label row space"><text>饮水量</text><text class="value">{{form.water_ml||0}} ml</text></view><view class="water-actions"><text bindtap="addWater" data-ml="250">+250 ml</text><text bindtap="addWater" data-ml="500">+500 ml</text></view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.water_ml}}" data-k="water_ml" bindinput="inp" placeholder="今日总饮水量"/></view>
<view class="card"><view class="grid"><view><view class="label">睡眠时长</view><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.sleep_hours}}" data-k="sleep_hours" bindinput="inp" placeholder="例如 7.5"/><view class="hint">小时</view></view><view><view class="label">体重</view><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.weight_kg}}" data-k="weight_kg" bindinput="inp" placeholder="例如 65.2"/><view class="hint">kg</view></view></view><view class="label steps">今日步数</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.steps}}" data-k="steps" bindinput="inp" placeholder="例如 6500"/></view>
<view class="section-title">今天感觉怎么样？</view><view class="moods"><block wx:for="{{moods}}" wx:key="k"><view class="mood {{form.mood==item.k?'selected':''}}" bindtap="mood" data-k="{{item.k}}"><view class="emoji">{{item.e}}</view><view>{{item.t}}</view></view></block></view>
<button class="btn-primary save" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存今日状态</button></view>
